rt he's a pretty mellow character so  what chikudi is telling us here is that  his character and guardians is the  opposite of him and even says that he  has to go to extreme levels to play this  character he needs a form of extremism  now obviously the opposite of kind of  mellow and calm is really over the top  and high energy and this kind of all  falls into line with the high  evolutionary the high evolutionary is an  extremist his mind is solely focused on  evolution in the beginning of his origin  story he evolved his dog into a creature  that had the intelligence of a  chimpanzee from there on out he would  continue to experiment on animals and  other beings until eventually some of  those animals that he experimented on  became an army for him then he left  earth to start his own earth on a  different planet he literally set out to  make earth 2. now from there a ton  happens and if you want to know what  happens you can watch my video on his  origin story but i've actually linked  him to a few things that we're going to  see in guardians of the galaxy which  kind of confirms that he is the high  evolutionary now who do we know in the  mcu and specifically the guardians  franchise who was set on evolution who  was set on perfection the sovereign they  even said in guardians 2 they don't make  babies the old-fashioned way anymore  women don't birth their babies they  actually make them and then we saw that  in the end adam's cocoon they made adam  warlock so it would make sense that the  high evolutionary is actually the person  in charge of the sovereign this would  require somebody who is an extremist as  chuck woody said also you can imagine  that a character like this is probably  over the top and not very quiet and  pretty outspoken which is the opposite  of mirn the character that chakwoody  plays in peacemaker now also in the  comics the high evolutionary kind of  adopts adam warlock as his son well if  the high evolutionary is in charge of  the sovereign then technically the  sovereign and the high evolutionary are  making adam warlock so he kind of would  be like a son in that perspective and as  far as continuity between all the  guardians of the galaxy film  specifically guardians 2 and 3 goes the  sovereign and another villain are going  to be the main antagonists of this movie  yes adam warlock is going to come into  play yes the sovereign is going to send  adam warlock to destroy the guardians of  the galaxy and perhaps he maybe even  successfully kills one of them but i  think we ultimately know that adam is  not going to be the main villain and  eventually will turn at least somewhat  good by the end of the film that will  leave us with a bigger villain but it  won't get the sovereign off the back of  the guardians of the galaxy they want to  destroy them this is where the person in  charge of the sovereign who i believe to  be the high evolutionary gets really mad  at aisha because in the post credit  scene we already knew that the council  was frustrated with aisha but then the  person in charge takes manners into his  or her hands but again i truly believe  this to be the high evolutionary because  it just all lines up and it'll be  interesting to see how the guardians  line up against adam warlock and then  the sovereign after because the  sovereign actually almost did kill the  guardians in guardians 2. if ego hadn't  have shown up and destroyed all of the  sovereign ships it looks like they would  have been toast they would have all died  which is kind of where adam warlock  comes into play because star-lord  doesn't have his celestial powers  anymore at least that's what we're made  to believe now i kind of think that  they're still there inside of him and  he'll tap into them somehow but for the  time being the guardians don't have a  godlike being with them that is able to  take on the sovereign that's where adam  warlock comes into play that's where he  switches sides and joins them that's  where the power comes from now how will  they be able to take on adam in the  first place not so sure they're  definitely going to have to all fight  together maybe thor comes on board and  he helps them fight him but remember  thor love and thunder takes place before  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 so don't  expect thor to be with him so the  guardians are going to have to come up  with some way to beat adam and then  they're all going to have to face who i  believe to be the high evolutionary in  charge of the sovereign but let me know  what you think about this in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe so you don't  miss out on any of the latest news for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof  you
 

